Chapter: NvGspRegistryTest
  cites Kernel chapter NvGspRegistry
  cites Foreword chapter Format

 The expected output is tinygrad's own rpc_set_registry_table, run by
 Python: build/nv-gsp-registry-oracle.ps1.

Section: Main

  hex-bytes : List Integer, Integer, Text -> Text
  hex-bytes (bs) (i) (acc) = if i >= list-length bs then acc else hex-bytes bs (i + 1) (acc & fmt-hex-pad (list-at bs i) 2)

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
   print-line-uni ("F " & show nv-gsp-fn-set-registry & " " & hex-bytes (nv-gsp-registry nv-gsp-registry-default) 0 "")
  end
